{"sourceUrl":"https://cs.dlut.edu.cn/info/1256/6450.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.029746+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cs.dlut.edu.cn/info/1256/6450.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><br/></p><p><span><span>大连理工大学计算机科学与技术学院</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生预报名系统现已开通，诚挚欢迎全国各高校</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>届推荐免试生申报我学院！有意向报考我院推免生的同学可登录</span><span>“大连理工大学接收推荐免试攻读研究生预报名系统”进行报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名网址为：</span><span>https://yjszs.dlut.edu.cn/zsbm/logon。具体要求如下：</span></span></p><p><span>一、</span><strong><span>报名要求</span></strong></p><p><span>1、申请者应为预计能够获得本科所在高校2026年推荐免试资格的应届毕业生，如未获得本科所在高校2026年推荐免试资格申请者的考核结果无效；</span></p><p><span>2、通过“我校接收推免生预报名系统”材料审核和我院考核的申请者，须按照规定时间在“全国推免服务系统”中填报我院，未在规定时间申报者前期考核结果无效。</span></p><p><span>二、</span><strong><span>接收报名专业</span></strong></p><div><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业类型</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>招生类型</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>081200</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术型</span></p></td><td><p><span>计算机科学与技术</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士</span><span>/直博</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085404</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业型</span></p></td><td><p><span>计算机技术</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士</span><span>/直博</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>0812J1</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术型</span></p></td><td><p><span>人工智能</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士</span><span>/直博</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>0</span><span>85410</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业型</span></p></td><td><p><span>人工智能</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士</span><span>/直博</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p><strong> </strong></p><p><span>三、</span><strong><span>时间要求</span></strong></p><p><span>报名</span><span>截止</span><span><span>时间：</span><span>9月</span></span><span>7</span><span>日</span><span>9</span><span>点；</span></p><p><span>确认复试</span><span>截止</span><span><span>时间：</span><span>9月1</span></span><span>1</span><span>日</span><span>9</span><span>点。</span></p><p><span>四、</span><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p><p><span>1、申请者登录“大连理工大学接收推荐免试攻读研究生预报名系统”https://yjszs.dlut.edu.cn/zsbm/logon 进行报名，报名前请仔细阅读申请须知，并按照要求完成申报；</span></p><p><span>注：</span><strong><span><span>招生项目请选择</span><span>“推免生预报名”。</span></span></strong></p><p><span>2、申请者须在报名系统中提交如下材料：</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）本科学习期间成绩单，需有本科所在学院或学校相关部门盖章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）本科学习期间成绩证明材料，需有本科所在学院或学校相关部门盖章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3）四六级成绩单或证书复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4）科技创新类奖项获奖证明、发表的<span>论文专利</span>证明材料等。</span></span></p><p><span>五、</span><strong><span>报名审核</span></strong></p><p><span>我院根据考生报名情况进行集中审核，</span><span>尽快</span><span><span>公布初审结果，请考生及时通过报名系统</span><span>“申请状态查询”模块查看。</span></span></p><p><span><span>通过初审的同学须于</span><span>9月1</span></span><span>1</span><span>日</span><span>9</span><span><span>点前在系统点击</span><span>“确认复试”，并加入钉钉群</span></span><strong><span>184490003694</span></strong><span><span>（备注</span><span>“申请专业+真实姓名”）。</span></span></p><p><span>六、</span><strong><span>考核安排</span></strong></p><p><span><span>我院计划在</span><span>9月下旬进行线下复试，具体时间及要求详见系统及钉钉群后续通知。</span></span></p><p><span>其他说明：若本通知与学校或上级单位发布的新规定不符，按照学校或上级单位发布的新规定执行。</span></p><p><span>七、</span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span>联系人：李老师</span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0411-84706007</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span><span>liyuqi@dlut.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>办公地点：海山楼</span><span>A1024</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"8e7034acf435fadd9c0a29c322482a1ecc6d7ffe14d65fb8f0da98305f69943a","textLength":966,"sourceSha256":"a0ef984b8a8802648ae72ded3366a1268a7ee12952f0eded9694f3f56805ddd9","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1b626623e8031934aaa8","title":"2026年大连理工大学计算机科学与技术学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.029746+00:00"}
